---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { products, site, statusMeta } from '../data/site';

const description =
  '给在 Beastry 仓库里写代码的人和代理的网站说明：任务在各仓库的 Issues，合并、发布和权限仍要人批准。';
const descriptionEn =
  'Website guidance for people and coding agents working in Beastry repositories. Tasks live in each repo’s issues. Merges, releases, and permissions still need a person.';

const checked = '2026-11-23';

const ruleFiles = [
  {
    href: 'https://github.com/Beastry/stow/blob/main/AGENTS.md',
    zh: 'Stow · AGENTS.md',
    en: 'Stow · AGENTS.md',
  },
  {
    href: 'https://github.com/Beastry/stow/blob/main/CLAUDE.md',
    zh: 'Stow · CLAUDE.md',
    en: 'Stow · CLAUDE.md',
  },
  {
    href: 'https://github.com/Beastry/stow/blob/main/RELEASING.md',
    zh: 'Stow · 发布说明',
    en: 'Stow · Releasing',
  },
  {
    href: 'https://github.com/Beastry/MijiaBar/blob/main/AGENTS.md',
    zh: 'MijiaBar · AGENTS.md',
    en: 'MijiaBar · AGENTS.md',
  },
  {
    href: 'https://github.com/Beastry/MijiaBar/blob/main/docs/AGENT_SETUP.md',
    zh: 'MijiaBar · Agent 安装说明（英文）',
    en: 'MijiaBar · Agent setup (English)',
  },
];
---

<Base title="给代理的说明" titleEn="For agents" description={description} descriptionEn={descriptionEn}>
  <article class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker"><span lang="zh-Hans">社区</span><span lang="en">Community</span></p>
      <h1><span lang="zh-Hans">给写代码的人和代理</span><span lang="en">For people and coding agents</span></h1>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        这是 beastry.app 上的说明，不是各产品仓库已经采纳的政策。仓库里的文件优先。本页不复制会变的版本号，也不复制未关闭的任务。索引在
        <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a>。下面列出的文件于 {checked} 在默认分支上核对过。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        This is guidance on beastry.app. It is not a policy already adopted by the product repositories. A file inside a repository wins. This page does not keep a copy of versions or open tasks. The index is
        <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a>. The files named below were checked on the default branch on {checked}.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">社区和现状</span><span lang="en">Community and status</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Beastry 是开源软件社区，仓库在
        <a href={site.github} rel="noreferrer">github.com/Beastry</a>。产品状态以
        <a href="/projects">项目</a>
        页为准，不在这里再记一版下载版本。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Beastry is an open-source community. The repositories are at
        <a href={site.github} rel="noreferrer">github.com/Beastry</a>. Product status lives on
        <a href="/projects">Projects</a>. Download versions are not copied here.
      </p>
      <ul>
        {
          products.map((product) => (
            <li>
              <a href={product.github} rel="noreferrer">
                {product.name}
              </a>
              {' · '}
              <span lang="zh-Hans">{statusMeta[product.status].zh}</span>
              <span lang="en">{statusMeta[product.status].en}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        公测是 Stow、MijiaBar、Octoshot。开发中是 AgentKey、Splatty、LetterBee。记忆面包在本站标为搁置；它的 README 仍有使用说明，并没有写“已搁置”。没有核实到的标志不会在这里补一张。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Public beta: Stow, MijiaBar, and Octoshot. In development: AgentKey, Splatty, and LetterBee. 记忆面包 is listed on this site as on hold. Its README still documents how to run it and does not say “on hold.” Marks that were not verified are not invented here.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">任务在哪里</span><span lang="en">Where the tasks are</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        前门在 <a href="/community">共建</a>。它打开时向 GitHub 读取 Beastry/ideas 的 Issue、带 <code>help wanted</code> 或 <code>good first issue</code> 的打开 Issue，以及最近合并的 Pull Request。本站不保存第二份任务清单。没有查询结果就显示没有。新的软件想法用
        <a href={site.ideaIssue} rel="noreferrer">Idea 模板</a>。角色或故事没有单独模板，只能打开一条标题预填为 <code>[Story]</code> 的 GitHub Issue。Bug 和建议的预填链接在
        <a href="/help">帮助</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        The front door is <a href="/community">Make together</a>. When it opens, it reads Beastry/ideas, open issues labeled <code>help wanted</code> or <code>good first issue</code>, and recently merged pull requests. This site does not keep a second task list. No query result means none. A new software idea uses the
        <a href={site.ideaIssue} rel="noreferrer">Idea template</a>. A character or story has no template of its own. The only handoff is a GitHub issue whose title is prefilled with <code>[Story]</code>. Prefilled bug and suggestion links are on
        <a href="/help">Help</a>.
      </p>
      <ul>
        {
          products.map((product) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`${product.github}/issues`} rel="noreferrer">
                {product.name} Issues
              </a>
              {product.extraLinks?.map((link) => (
                <>
                  {' · '}
                  <a href={link.href} rel={link.href.startsWith('http') ? 'noreferrer' : undefined}>
                    <span lang="zh-Hans">{link.zh}</span>
                    <span lang="en">{link.en}</span>
                  </a>
                </>
              ))}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        {checked} 核对过：只有
        <a href="https://github.com/Beastry/ideas" rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a>
        有 Issue 模板（<code>idea.yml</code>）。Stow、MijiaBar、Octoshot 的 <code>.github</code> 里当时只有 workflows，没有 Issue 模板。没有模板的仓库，用仓库自己的 Issues 页面即可。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Checked on {checked}: only
        <a href="https://github.com/Beastry/ideas" rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a>
        had an issue template (<code>idea.yml</code>). Stow, MijiaBar, and Octoshot then had workflows under <code>.github</code> and no issue template. Where there is no template, use that repository’s issues page.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">怎么参与</span><span lang="en">How to contribute</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        在对应仓库开 Issue，或在已有 Issue 下留言，让人看见你在做什么。代码用 Pull Request 提出。本站没有认领名单，也没有代为分配任务的账号。+1、提交和留言必须由一个负责的人用自己的 GitHub 账号发出。代理可以起草，不能代替这个人发出，也不能因此发布版本。仓库自己的文件如果写了别的步骤，以那个文件为准。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Open an issue in the relevant repository, or comment on an existing one, so a person can see the work. Propose code with a pull request. This site has no claim list and no account that assigns tasks. A +1, a submission, and a comment must be sent by a responsible person with their own GitHub account. An agent may draft them and may not send them instead of that person, and may not publish a release because of them. If that repository’s own file describes different steps, follow the file.
      </p>
      <ul>
        {
          ruleFiles.map((file) => (
            <li>
              <a href={file.href} rel="noreferrer">
                <span lang="zh-Hans">{file.zh}</span>
                <span lang="en">{file.en}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        {checked} 在组织里按文件名查找：<code>AGENTS.md</code> 只有 Stow 和 MijiaBar；<code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> 只有 Splatty。Octoshot、AgentKey、LetterBee、记忆面包和本站仓库 Beastry/beastry.app 当时没有这两份文件。不要在别处新建它们来配合本页。Stow 根目录另有 <code>CLAUDE.md</code>，内容以文件本身为准，本页不转述。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        A filename search of the organization on {checked} found <code>AGENTS.md</code> only in Stow and MijiaBar, and <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> only in Splatty. Octoshot, AgentKey, LetterBee, 记忆面包, and this website repository, Beastry/beastry.app, did not have either file. Do not create those files elsewhere to match this page. Stow also has <code>CLAUDE.md</code> in its root. Read that file; this page does not restate it.
      </p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Splatty 的贡献说明欢迎脚手架、文档和流水线脚本的 Issue 与 PR，并要求范围与 README 里的非目标一致，除非先和维护者讨论过。第一方贡献为 GPL-3.0-only。细节以那份文件为准。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Splatty’s contributing file welcomes issues and pull requests for scaffolding, docs, and pipeline scripts, and asks that the scope stay aligned with the non-goals in its README unless discussed with the maintainer first. First-party contributions there are GPL-3.0-only. The file itself has the details.
      </p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Stow 的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 写给 Codex，并写明同样适用于 Grok Bot。它划分了界面视觉与功能正确性的负责人，并写了构建、签名的系统集成文件要和发布协作者配合。其中“已经获准的工作不再加一道用户批准”只描述 Stow 这份文件里的分工，不是其他仓库的规则，也不等于可以合并或发布。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Stow’s <code>AGENTS.md</code> is written for Codex and says the same rules apply to Grok Bot. It splits visual design from functional correctness, and it says signed system-integration artifacts are coordinated with the release collaborator. Its note that already authorized work does not add another user approval gate describes that split inside Stow’s file. It is not a rule for other repositories, and it is not permission to merge or publish.
      </p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        MijiaBar 的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 写给 Codex、Claude Code、Cursor 等。它要求 PR 只做一个主题，并列出未在真机上验证的检查。更新源的发布和提交仍是手工步骤。新增应用语言要维护者决定。不要手改它标明由脚本生成的文件，也不要提交令牌、设备标识或真实设备名。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        MijiaBar’s <code>AGENTS.md</code> is written for Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, and similar tools. It asks for one topic per pull request and a list of checks that were not run on a real device. Publishing and committing the update feed stay manual. Adding an app language needs a maintainer decision. Do not hand-edit files it says are generated, and do not commit tokens, device identifiers, or real device names.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">需要做的验证</span><span lang="en">Verification</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        跑那个仓库文档里点名的检查。Stow 看 <code>DEVELOPING.md</code> 和 <code>AGENTS.md</code>，MijiaBar 看它的 <code>AGENTS.md</code>，Splatty 看 <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> 和架构说明。本页不把那些命令再抄一份。Pull Request 里写明你跑了什么，以及哪一项没跑、为什么。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Run the checks that repository’s own docs name. For Stow, start with <code>DEVELOPING.md</code> and <code>AGENTS.md</code>. For MijiaBar, start with its <code>AGENTS.md</code>. For Splatty, start with <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> and the architecture note. Those commands are not copied here. In the pull request, say what you ran and what you could not run.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">仍要人批准的事</span><span lang="en">What still needs a person</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        合并 Pull Request、发布版本、改仓库权限，以及改 Cloudflare 配置，都要该仓库的维护者本人决定。本页不授予这些权限，本站也没有代理账号或登录。写信：
        <a href="mailto:community@beastry.app">community@beastry.app</a>、
        <a href="mailto:hello@beastry.app">hello@beastry.app</a>、
        <a href="mailto:security@beastry.app">security@beastry.app</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Merging a pull request, publishing a release, changing repository permissions, and changing Cloudflare configuration are decisions for a human maintainer of that repository. This page does not grant them. This site has no agent account and no login. Write to
        <a href="mailto:community@beastry.app">community@beastry.app</a>,
        <a href="mailto:hello@beastry.app">hello@beastry.app</a>, or
        <a href="mailto:security@beastry.app">security@beastry.app</a>.
      </p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Stow 的签名集成文件按它自己的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 和 <code>RELEASING.md</code> 与发布协作者配合。MijiaBar 的更新源按它自己的 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 仍由人发布。这两条都不是全组织的发布政策。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Signed integration files for Stow are coordinated with the release collaborator, as that repo’s <code>AGENTS.md</code> and <code>RELEASING.md</code> describe. MijiaBar’s update feed is still published by a person, as its <code>AGENTS.md</code> describes. Neither sentence is an organization-wide release policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
